    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your connection to the Song of the Maker ensures you always have certain spells ready. When you reach a Bard level specified in the Maker Domain Spells table, you thereafter always have the listed spells prepared. When you cast a spell from the Maker Domain Spells table you only need to use the Verbal component.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Bard Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>Command, Healing Word, Suggestion, Zone of Truth</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Fear, Mass Healing Word</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Compulsion, Phantasmal Killer</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>Dominate Person, Geas</td></tr></tbody></table><ul><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.64bf387a0bb53756]{Command}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.9445baac9e47469e]{Healing Word}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.56cab499f72fe7de]{Suggestion}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.bae0747f7c58a4a7]{Zone of Truth}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.99e28fc486bee80b]{Fear}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.bf16e75a81737cab]{Mass Healing Word}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.841e99a84433a42a]{Compulsion}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.d4324b6fc1295d91]{Phantasmal Killer}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.d7a47f7d112978eb]{Dominate Person}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.b0de415f6a0858d1]{Geas}</li></ul>"
    },
